5. GİB e-Arşiv Paketi (report schema, v1.20)
   Location: schemas/earchive/
   Publisher: Gelir İdaresi Başkanlığı
   Source: https://ebelge.gib.gov.tr/dosyalar/kilavuzlar/earsiv_paket_v1.20.zip
   (announced 2026-11-05)
   Retrieved: 2026-11-15
   SHA-256 (zip): 36abf382079d857f96450f81aa294a863e919d3bb7f58d41f3c41cf75151a8f8
   SHA-256 (EArsiv.xsd): ae9e7dd451ef65c68b9c68c0311ab41905a24b799912654da1755f6ee202c6a6
   The package names the file eArsiv.xsd; it is stored here as EArsiv.xsd.
   The other vendored XSDs are unchanged from v1.1.8.
   Vendored unmodified: EArsiv.xsd, eArsivVeri.xsd, faturaOzet.xsd, XAdES.xsd,
   XAdESv141.xsd, xmldsig-core-schema.xsd. WSDL, the package XSLT and the
   report Schematron (earsiv_schematron.xsl, new in v1.20) are not vendored. This is the e-Arşiv *report* (root eArsivRaporu), not the UBL
   Invoice used for e-Arşiv invoices (ProfileID EARSIVFATURA).
   XAdES.xsd / XAdESv141.xsd are ETSI XML Advanced Electronic Signatures
   schemas; xmldsig-core-schema.xsd is the W3C XML Signature schema. Notices
   in those files are retained. This project does not generate a Go XAdES
   model; ds:Signature is kept as InnerXML.

